# .secretscanignore — files the secret scanner skips entirely (one regex per
# line, `#` comments, blank lines ignored). Used sparingly: a file listed here
# is no longer checked, so prefer marking a single line with `secretscan:allow`
# or fixing the placeholder value instead. See docs/SECRET_SCANNING.md.
#
# Example:
#   ^docs/demo/fixtures/.*\.json$
